@host = http://localhost:4005

### Create Event with Multipart Form and File Upload
POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>

------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Tech Conference 2025
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A conference about the latest in tech.
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="startDate"

2025-09-15T09:00:00.000Z
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="endDate"

2025-09-17T18:00:00.000Z
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Cairo International Convention Center
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="eventType"

team-meeting
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="createdBy"

507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz--

### Get All Events
GET {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>

### Get Event by ID
GET {{host}}/api/events/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>

### Update Event
PATCH {{host}}/api/events/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>

------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Tech Conference 2025
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

An updated conference about the latest in tech with new speakers.
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Updated Cairo International Convention Center
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="updated-test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------GnourEventBoundaryXyz--

### Update Event (JSON - without file)
PATCH {{host}}/api/events/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>

{
  "title": "Updated Tech Conference 2025",
  "description": "An updated conference about the latest in tech with new speakers.",
  "location": "Updated Cairo International Convention Center",
  "eventType": "conference"
}

### Delete Event
DELETE {{host}}/api/events/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>